  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.<br>• Cut cauliflower into small florets.<br>• Cut potato into bite-sized chunks.<br>• Thickly slice carrot into half-moons.<br>• Place veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive <br>oil, sprinkle with half the Mumbai spice blend and <br>season with pepper. Toss to coat.<br>• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.<br>TIP: If your tray is getting crowded, divide the veggies <br>between two trays.  </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cacd2c76eddc47d13e0d/step-36472900.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, finely chop brown onion (see <br>ingredients) and garlic. <br>• Rince red lentils. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cacd2c76eddc47d13e0d/step-4103d310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When the veggies have 15 minutes remaining, heat <br>a saucepan over medium-high heat with the plant<br>based butter and a drizzle of olive oil. Cook onion, <br>stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes.<br>• Add garlic, remaining Mumbai spice blend, lentils <br>and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using). Cook until <br>fragrant, 1-2 minutes.<br>• Add coconut milk, the water and stock <br>concentrate. Bring to a simmer, then reduce heat to <br>low. Cover with a lid and simmer until thickened,  <br>3-6 minutes.<br>• Uncover, then continue to simmer until tender,  <br>10 minutes.  </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cacd2c76eddc47d13e0d/step-2a91fb20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over <br>medium-high heat.<br>• Cook mini flour tortillas (see ingredients) in <br>batches, until golden, 1-2 minutes each side.<br>• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cacd2c76eddc47d13e0d/step-167d2330.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When the lentils are ready, add roasted veggies to <br>the pan.<br>• Gently stir to combine, then season to taste with <br>salt and pepper. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cacd2c76eddc47d13e0d/step-5eb8db40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Roughly chop coriander.<br>• Divide cauliflower and lentil aloo gobi between bowls.<br>• Sprinkle with coriander and extra chilli flakes <br>(if using). Serve with mango chutney and toasted <br>tortillas. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cacd2c76eddc47d13e0d/step-e18edd50.jpg"
    }
  ]
